      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure I understand this, you can't pull up the quick menu to clone the avatar from another user? or they won't put themselves into a cloneable state for you?\nThe first problem does not appear to be at the fault of vrchat if your computer does not meet minimum spec. If you perhaps think you have found a bug you should get reproducible steps and post it as a bug report. \nAlternatively you should be able to click a user then see avatar author which would bring you to the creator who uploaded that avatar, and if it is a public avatar there may be an avatar world listed in their worlds.",
