      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: i am aware that my computer graphics card is not entirely up to spec, but the rest of it is. Sadly this issue is not exclusive to myself. Besides, it would be neat to have a function that allows a temporary avatar pedestal to be dropped. You could also have it set to be for friends only or public. (Similar to how portal drops work)",
