  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-10T15:43:32.626Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have had this issue all too often where I find an avatar that i like, but due to my computer's inability to pull up the secondary HUD for cloning, and an someone not knowing their avatar's original source, I can not get access to the avatars that i would like.\nIt would be nice to have the ability to drop a temporary avatar pedestal for people to clone avatars and favorite them.",
